<title>UK: CSFB sets call warrants on Novartis.</title>
<headline>CSFB sets call warrants on Novartis.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston says it has issued two million American-style call warrants, on Novartis AG.</p>
<p>20 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,750.00 CHF	    PREMIUM	9.53 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     5.60 CHF		  GEARING	15.2 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 13.MAR.97-25.FEB.98   PAYDATE	12.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 20</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1,700.00 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES	     </p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
